  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8378694707410664638}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 21284d41b338fe94ab7d9509d5fa5ddd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  txtMessage: {fileID: 6126020398185312969}
  animator: {fileID: 5753448400515777008}
  firstMessages:
  - Another day at the HQ. It was no picnic, working at MegaCorp Inc. maintenance,
    but at least this time, a hard-working handyman gets to have a pretty scenic
    spot for a smoke break.
  - "The AC up here was on the fritz, or so I was told. The deskies always have something
    to blame when they can\u2019t meet their quotas."
  - 'At least the case was clear: a worn-out capacitor. A simple thing to fix, if
    only we had the right part in stock.'
  - "Well, they\u2019re just going to have to hold on a little longer."
  secondMessages:
  - At least I get to enjoy the view.
  - "Well, time to head back down\u2026"
  clearColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
